# Seat 1 calls 5m from seat 0 and draws the fourth 9m from rinshan.
# Seat 2 has single-wait Kokushi on 9m (pair 1m) and robs the ankan.
# The open kan's owed 1p indicator precedes the ankan announcement under
# the written chained-kan order. No 7p indicator or second replacement follows.
# Nondealer single yakuman base 8000 * 4 = 32000 from seat 1 to seat 2.
# Zero sticks and honba; the nondealer win advances the deal.

